{"id":"00002","root":"uni00002_1","name":{"ja":"槇島　あやめ","en":"Makishima Ayame"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"槇島　あやめ","en":"Makishima Ayame"},"aliases":["Ayame Makishima"],"element":"Superhuman","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2018-09-25","limited":false,"characterId":2,"profile":{"ja":"対魔忍。紅に長年付き従っている忠実なる従者。将来を嘱望されたエリート対魔忍だったが、ある事件で紅に命を救われたことからその強さと優しさに心酔して自ら志願して紅の従者となる。“風読み”と呼ばれる目に関わる異能を持つ。これは周囲の風の流れを察知することで驚異的な精度での狙撃を可能にする他、高度な空間把握・状況認識を持つことで予知に近いレベルでの“先読み”が可能になる。一見柔和なお姉さんと言った雰囲気だが、主である紅を守るためならどのような手段も厭わない苛烈な一面を持つ。","en":"She is a Taimanin and the loyal attendant who has served Kurenai for many years. Once a promising elite Taimanin, she volunteered to become Kurenai's follower after Kurenai saved her life during a certain incident, becoming enamored with Kurenai's strength and kindness. She possesses the \"Wind-reading\" ability, an ocular power that lets her sense the flow of wind around her, granting her sniper precision of astonishing accuracy and granting her advanced spatial awareness and situational perception that borders on precognition. Though she gives off the aura of a gentle older sister, she harbors a fierce side that will stop at nothing to protect her master, Kurenai."},"illustrator":"ＺＯＬ","voiceActor":"伊東サラ","forms":[{"id":"uni00002_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1260,2524],"sp":[170,170],"atk":[130,261],"def":[161,323],"spd":[54,54],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":35,"skills":["1","9"]},{"id":"uni00002_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1920,3841],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[185,375],"def":[247,494],"spd":[54,54],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":35,"skills":["1","9","10"]},{"id":"uni00002_3","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","levelMax":100,"stats":{"hp":[2580,5165],"sp":[350,350],"atk":[240,483],"def":[333,666],"spd":[54,54],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":35,"skills":["1","9","10","11"]}],"skills":{"1":{"slot":"attack","id":1,"name":null,"hits":2,"cutin":false,"levels